WEBVTT

00:00.860 --> 00:02.090
<b>Prepare yourself.</b>

00:02.720 --> 00:06.790
<b>I will absolutely and 
unequivocally have my revenge!</b>

00:07.690 --> 00:08.530
<b>Alice?!</b>

00:13.260 --> 00:14.080
<b>Alice...</b>

00:16.930 --> 00:18.360
<b>Iska...?</b>

00:19.430 --> 00:20.690
<b>Alice...?</b>

00:24.420 --> 00:28.750
<b>Of all times... Why do you have to show up now?</b>

00:29.960 --> 00:36.550
<b>We can't call ourselves rivals anymore.</b>

00:37.190 --> 00:42.450
<b>Alice? What are you talking about? 
Never mind that, Sisbell—</b>

00:42.450 --> 00:44.630
<b>Didn't I tell you to stay 
in the vacation house?!</b>

00:44.630 --> 00:49.670
<b>Wha... Listen to me, Alice! 
Sisbell got kidnapped!</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:53.350
<b>Vichyssoise got out of the prison and destroyed 
Lou's vacation house to abduct her!</b>

00:54.340 --> 00:56.120
<b>Sisbell did?</b>

00:56.430 --> 00:59.500
<b>I'm only here because I was chasing after her!</b>

00:59.500 --> 01:01.150
<b>Are you speaking the truth?</b>

01:03.410 --> 01:05.970
<b>But even if I wanted to 
believe you, I just can't.</b>

01:06.690 --> 01:08.430
<b>Because the Imperial army is our enemy,</b>

01:09.050 --> 01:13.590
<b>and I am the princess who 
will take the queen's place.</b>

01:14.370 --> 01:20.800
<b>Sisbell got kidnapped, you say? Isn't that the 
Imperial army's doing and not Vichyssoise?</b>

01:15.240 --> 01:22.130
<b>Last Crusade: Our Last Crusade or
 the Night We Make Our Vow</b>

01:20.800 --> 01:23.700
<b>And what if you were the accomplice 
who helped carry it out?</b>

01:24.130 --> 01:26.980
<b>Alice?! Wh-What's gotten into you?!</b>

01:26.980 --> 01:28.740
<b>I can't trust the words you say</b>

01:28.740 --> 01:31.080
<b>because you're one of the Imperials!</b>

01:33.630 --> 01:40.000
<b>I saw Elletear and Mother get 
cut down right before my own eyes</b>

01:40.440 --> 01:42.590
<b>by a Saint Disciple just like you!</b>

01:42.910 --> 01:44.880
<b>Wh-What?!</b>

01:45.290 --> 01:47.350
<b>We've passed the point of no return.</b>

01:48.030 --> 01:50.450
<b>Because my family and subordinate were harmed.</b>

01:51.880 --> 01:52.980
<b>What...</b>

01:53.480 --> 01:56.300
<b>What exactly am I sad and crying about?</b>

01:57.200 --> 01:59.500
<b>The fact that my family was harmed?</b>

02:00.590 --> 02:01.670
<b>Or...</b>

02:03.070 --> 02:07.410
<b>I am the second princess of the 
Nebulis Sovereignty, Aliceliese.</b>

02:07.970 --> 02:11.930
<b>I must destroy the Empire.
Even if that means going against you.</b>

02:12.520 --> 02:13.650
<b>Alice...</b>

02:14.590 --> 02:16.860
<b>Why?! Just why?!</b>

02:17.280 --> 02:22.390
<b>This isn't how I wanted to go against you!</b>

02:27.820 --> 02:30.550
<b>Oh, that's it.</b>

02:32.150 --> 02:34.850
<b>That's probably why I'm crying.</b>

02:35.500 --> 02:41.730
<b>Forget about the tension between the Empire 
and the Sovereignty and have our crusade.</b>

02:43.230 --> 02:44.860
<b>That's what I hoped for.</b>

02:52.270 --> 02:56.230
<b>Former Saint Disciple Iska, 
I am declaring war on you.</b>

02:56.890 --> 03:00.750
<b>Alice?! Now's not the time to—</b>

03:01.030 --> 03:06.250
<b>I didn't want to go against you 
while feeling like a wreck either.</b>

03:07.880 --> 03:12.620
<b>This isn't how I wanted to end things!</b>

03:14.970 --> 03:19.770
<b>Oh, such an intense brilliance 
of an astral spirit.</b>

03:20.110 --> 03:27.410
<b>If it isn't the Second Princess 
Aliceliese, one of Milla's daughters.</b>

03:28.200 --> 03:30.660
<b>And that Imperial swordsman...</b>

03:31.690 --> 03:37.010
<b>I don't understand. What is he 
still doing in the Sovereignty?</b>

03:37.640 --> 03:39.750
<b>Above all—</b>

03:40.610 --> 03:45.520
<b>Aliceliese, you're Milla's daughter after all.</b>

03:46.110 --> 03:52.590
<b>You must be convinced that the Imperial 
army is behind this attack, aren't you?</b>

03:56.050 --> 04:01.270
<b>I see. What a strange and 
fateful destiny this is.</b>

04:02.880 --> 04:07.300
<b>Salinger, you're absolutely well-built,
I must say.</b>

04:07.300 --> 04:09.470
<b>Is it because of you're oblivious?</b>

04:10.830 --> 04:16.720
<b>You're a heinous criminal who stole more 
than 100 astral spirits in the Sovereignty.</b>

04:16.720 --> 04:24.130
<b>You're also after mine, too. So, you deserve 
to be executed right here right now.</b>

04:30.440 --> 04:36.460
<b>However, it was quite refreshing.
So I will spare your life once again.</b>

04:37.320 --> 04:40.910
<b>She's the next queen contender?</b>

04:46.910 --> 04:53.650
<b>Salinger, you can't even beat me when it comes
to brute force? What are you going to do now?</b>

05:00.620 --> 05:04.500
<b>Salinger, you're sloppy with your astral art.</b>

05:04.990 --> 05:10.960
<b>The strongest queen contender, 
Millavair Lou Nebulis VIII.</b>

05:11.590 --> 05:14.300
<b>A combat doll that doesn't hold any emotions.</b>

05:14.860 --> 05:21.350
<b>But one day, that impression 
turns around 180 degrees.</b>

05:22.070 --> 05:23.720
<b>Salinger?</b>

05:26.030 --> 05:27.110
<b>You!</b>

05:32.440 --> 05:33.730
<b>What's so funny?!</b>

05:34.820 --> 05:41.080
<b>Wh-What is this, Salinger? A-Are you trying 
to kill me by making me laugh hard?</b>

05:43.200 --> 05:44.780
<b>What?</b>

05:45.410 --> 05:52.450
<b>Salinger is walking outside 
holding grocery bags in his hands!</b>

05:53.180 --> 05:57.480
<b>The man who challenges me saying,</b>

05:57.480 --> 06:00.490
<b>"Milla, today is the day where 
I make you kneel on the ground!"</b>

06:00.490 --> 06:03.760
<b>Actually lines up at the supermarket 
cashier with the ladies...</b>

06:03.510 --> 06:06.730
<b>I'm losing it just picturing that!</b>

06:09.550 --> 06:12.840
<b>I can't stop laughing! You win!</b>

06:13.890 --> 06:15.410
<b>Hey, Milla!</b>

06:20.530 --> 06:24.070
<b>You even bought meat marked as discounted items!</b>

06:24.070 --> 06:28.230
<b>I bet you went through a fierce 
battle with the ladies!</b>

06:29.090 --> 06:30.120
<b>Shut up!</b>

06:36.010 --> 06:39.030
<b>That combat doll actually laughs, too?</b>

06:40.830 --> 06:45.790
<b>Things stayed exactly the same even 
after our encounter at the city.</b>

06:46.240 --> 06:50.810
<b>And I kept challenging her 
for her astral spirit.</b>

06:51.770 --> 06:59.450
<b>But when did I start feeling like this?
The fights we had started to become precious.</b>

07:00.070 --> 07:05.870
<b>Salinger, why do you repeat the same move? 
You're quite consistent, aren't you?</b>

07:09.620 --> 07:16.320
<b>I started wishing that this relationship 
between us will continue forever deep down inside.</b>

07:17.760 --> 07:22.190
<b>However, everything fell apart in that moment.</b>

07:22.800 --> 07:24.870
<b>Her Queen the Majesty...</b>

07:27.510 --> 07:29.070
<b>Salinger!</b>

07:29.680 --> 07:36.270
<b>Was it... Was it you who attacked 
Her Majesty the Queen?!</b>

07:42.670 --> 07:44.210
<b>Answer me!</b>

07:45.600 --> 07:48.970
<b>Salinger! Why?!</b>

07:48.970 --> 07:52.050
<b>Why did you do such a thing?!</b>

07:54.880 --> 08:04.950
<b>I thought you were my only rival. Despite our
circumstances, I enjoyed my time with you.</b>

08:06.970 --> 08:10.360
<b>Why did you have to ruin it!</b>

08:13.380 --> 08:22.300
<b>I never wanted to fight you 
with such a twisted heart!</b>

08:23.440 --> 08:27.970
<b>How ridiculous. Nothing 
has changed in this world.</b>

08:28.560 --> 08:31.950
<b>It was Hydra that was behind the 
"Seventh Queen's Assassination Plan"</b>

08:32.290 --> 08:34.250
<b>that took place 37 years ago, too.</b>

08:34.890 --> 08:41.670
<b>You two are too good to endure the 
bloody feud seething with grudges.</b>

08:42.030 --> 08:47.570
<b>You should've seen this tragedy 
coming your way eventually.</b>

08:48.620 --> 08:49.750
<b>What a fool.</b>

08:50.310 --> 08:54.540
<b>Are you just going to repeat the 
same mistake as the last time?</b>

08:55.560 --> 09:01.230
<b>I wonder when and how was our 
course of fate disrupted?</b>

09:02.040 --> 09:07.220
<b>Regardless of being enemies, I thought we had 
a connection that transcended our positions.</b>

09:11.660 --> 09:13.620
<b>Alice, listen to me!</b>

09:13.620 --> 09:16.410
<b>I came running here because 
I want to save Sisbell!</b>

09:16.410 --> 09:22.470
<b>I cannot accept what you say! You people 
breached the point of no return!</b>

09:23.440 --> 09:28.430
<b>This war will not stop.
Not until one side perishes!</b>

09:28.910 --> 09:31.400
<b>Is that what you truly believe?</b>

09:32.130 --> 09:37.640
<b>It's what the Sovereignty wishes for.
It's out of my hands.</b>

09:38.710 --> 09:42.060
<b>Come at me like you mean to kill me, Iska!</b>

09:42.060 --> 09:43.220
<b>Alice!</b>

09:43.820 --> 09:45.070
<b>The ground!</b>

09:49.700 --> 09:51.560
<b>A mirror of ice?!</b>

09:52.240 --> 09:55.730
<b>Will she hit me with ice? Or confine me?</b>

09:56.280 --> 10:00.060
<b>But something feels different about this. 
What's the purpose of it reflecting me?</b>

10:00.710 --> 10:02.460
<b>Should I break it piece by piece?</b>

10:02.460 --> 10:05.960
<b>Ice Calamity: Rippling Light in the Vast Dust!</b>

10:10.550 --> 10:12.220
<b>So that's what the mirrors were for!</b>

10:16.290 --> 10:20.500
<b>As always. Your instincts 
are unbelievably sharp.</b>

10:21.120 --> 10:24.100
<b>I wouldn't have made it if I 
went on breaking the mirrors.</b>

10:24.560 --> 10:29.950
<b>That's right. I thought you'll break 
them before doing anything else.</b>

10:30.340 --> 10:32.200
<b>That was the trap I set.</b>

10:32.610 --> 10:35.660
<b>That sounds like a special 
countermeasure against me.</b>

10:36.060 --> 10:40.930
<b>That's exactly what I'm saying. Because it 
won't mean anything against anyone else.</b>

10:41.560 --> 10:44.500
<b>You're really going to do 
whatever it takes, huh?</b>

10:45.180 --> 10:47.920
<b>Come at me with everything you've got, Iska.</b>

10:47.920 --> 10:51.380
<b>Just like the time when we 
fought at the Nelka forest.</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:56.010
<b>I'll fight you just like you're just 
another nameless Imperial swordsman.</b>

10:56.550 --> 10:59.190
<b>I have to save Sisbell—</b>

10:59.580 --> 11:04.310
<b>But I must settle things with Alice 
now of all the possible moments?!</b>

11:05.590 --> 11:09.440
<b>Out of my way, Alice! I need to get through!</b>

11:09.440 --> 11:12.150
<b>You can once you slash me!</b>

11:13.200 --> 11:14.070
<b>Shoot!</b>

11:14.100 --> 11:15.470
<b>Great Ice Calamity!</b>

11:20.090 --> 11:21.800
<b>I knew you'd dodge it.</b>

11:25.000 --> 11:27.740
<b>In the end, Rin was right all along.</b>

11:28.350 --> 11:35.850
<b>She always said how you, Iska, would one
day become the biggest threat to me.</b>

11:36.460 --> 11:39.190
<b>So I mustn't open my heart to you.</b>

11:39.980 --> 11:43.230
<b>Same goes for you if you're 
talking about threats.</b>

11:46.070 --> 11:46.860
<b>Say.</b>

11:50.210 --> 11:52.510
<b>Go ahead and call me a witch.</b>

11:53.850 --> 11:58.150
<b>Because I'm an enemy to the Imperial army.</b>

11:58.580 --> 12:03.540
<b>So, I'll accept it even if you call me a witch.</b>

12:04.820 --> 12:05.760
<b>Alice.</b>

12:06.590 --> 12:08.290
<b>Your voice is trembling.</b>

12:08.990 --> 12:11.880
<b>I'm not interested in those 
who overexert themselves in self-mockery.</b>

12:13.760 --> 12:18.850
<b>Nothing good comes out of that. I also—</b>

12:19.240 --> 12:20.180
<b>Stop!</b>

12:20.530 --> 12:25.090
<b>Please stop. Don't say nice things to me.</b>

12:26.700 --> 12:34.110
<b>I need to act as the princess of 
Nebulis. I must destroy the Empire.</b>

12:34.930 --> 12:41.250
<b>So that's enough. Forget about 
everything and just fight me!</b>

12:41.790 --> 12:44.730
<b>Ice Calamity: Thousand Thorn Blizzard!</b>

12:47.480 --> 12:52.200
<b>It's no use. I knew from the start,
but there's no way I can go easy on her.</b>

12:52.200 --> 12:54.950
<b>I'm up against Alice who's not holding back!</b>

12:54.950 --> 12:56.420
<b>Come at me, Iska!</b>

13:02.780 --> 13:03.970
<b>From underneath?!</b>

13:11.850 --> 13:14.900
<b>Now, come at me, Iska. Let's end it here.</b>

13:15.130 --> 13:17.800
<b>We must put an end to our fighting.</b>

13:18.140 --> 13:23.210
<b>I shall curse the fate that that 
imposed a choice I never desired!</b>

13:23.580 --> 13:29.700
<b>The destiny of stars—is this 
the world you wished for?</b>

13:31.890 --> 13:35.910
<b>The royal family repeats its own mistake.</b>

13:36.470 --> 13:38.090
<b>How unbearable to watch.</b>

13:46.420 --> 13:47.760
<b>This is the end!</b>

13:48.170 --> 13:49.080
<b>Ice Calamity!</b>

13:53.040 --> 13:54.270
<b>That light?!</b>

13:54.680 --> 13:56.750
<b>Only when I activate the Ice Calamity</b>

13:56.750 --> 14:01.470
<b>does my astral spirit leave my body 
and transfer itself to this seed.</b>

14:02.020 --> 14:05.040
<b>The seed is my astral spirit itself.</b>

14:05.870 --> 14:08.020
<b>That's why I couldn't slash it back then.</b>

14:09.470 --> 14:14.790
<b>I will not hide anything.
Because this is truly the end!</b>

14:15.220 --> 14:16.000
<b>Huh?</b>

14:23.240 --> 14:24.750
<b>Did she miss me on purpose?</b>

14:27.010 --> 14:27.860
<b>No.</b>

14:30.810 --> 14:34.750
<b>Wh-What is it, Iska? Why did you stop running?!</b>

14:35.360 --> 14:36.900
<b>You won't hit me.</b>

14:37.130 --> 14:38.360
<b>Yes, I will!</b>

14:38.750 --> 14:39.910
<b>No, you won't.</b>

14:44.370 --> 14:47.160
<b>You can hardly see me</b>

14:47.580 --> 14:48.790
<b>with those eyes.</b>

14:56.320 --> 14:57.760
<b>Let's stop this.</b>

14:58.330 --> 15:04.610
<b>I'll be blunt. I don't want to fight 
you when you've lost yourself to anger.</b>

15:04.610 --> 15:07.580
<b>Now's not the time we fight, Alice.</b>

15:07.580 --> 15:09.850
<b>I feel the same way, too!</b>

15:10.230 --> 15:14.360
<b>But I can't forgive the Imperial army!</b>

15:14.360 --> 15:17.220
<b>That's where you're wrong to begin with.</b>

15:17.690 --> 15:18.560
<b>Huh?</b>

15:18.560 --> 15:22.410
<b>Sisbell's kidnap and letting 
in the Imperial army</b>

15:22.410 --> 15:24.950
<b>were all done by the descendant 
of the Founder, just like you.</b>

15:25.530 --> 15:28.000
<b>One of them is Elletear.</b>

15:28.310 --> 15:29.940
<b>Elletear did?!</b>

15:29.940 --> 15:32.030
<b>Sisbell told me herself.</b>

15:33.400 --> 15:36.050
<b>You're not going to believe 
your own sister's words either?</b>

15:36.050 --> 15:40.880
<b>That's not it! I cannot trust 
that Sisbell was saying so.</b>

15:40.880 --> 15:44.590
<b>Because those are your words!</b>

15:45.170 --> 15:49.190
<b>I was suspecting that Elletear 
may be involved in the coup.</b>

15:49.890 --> 15:56.720
<b>But I saw the very moment where Elletear 
got slashed protecting my mother.</b>

15:56.720 --> 16:00.010
<b>That's suspicious to begin with. Because–</b>

16:00.010 --> 16:02.940
<b>How can I suspect my own 
sister after witnessing—</b>

16:02.940 --> 16:04.200
<b>Listen to me!</b>

16:05.620 --> 16:11.540
<b>Listen, Alice. Lou's vacation house 
was destroyed by Hydra's attack.</b>

16:11.540 --> 16:15.450
<b>The Vicious Tyrant, Talisman, fights 
by enhancing his combat skills</b>

16:15.450 --> 16:18.550
<b>through the astral spirit of waves.</b>

16:18.550 --> 16:21.870
<b>What I'm saying should be correct.</b>

16:21.870 --> 16:23.470
<b>B-But...</b>

16:24.100 --> 16:25.020
<b>But what?</b>

16:25.500 --> 16:28.080
<b>I can't be the judge of that.</b>

16:28.550 --> 16:31.090
<b>Because I can't rule out the Imperial army</b>

16:31.090 --> 16:35.850
<b>looking into Lord Talisman's 
astral spirit beforehand.</b>

16:36.630 --> 16:41.310
<b>That's what he'll say even if we prosecute him!</b>

16:43.250 --> 16:46.370
<b>As the princess, I can't trust the 
words of the Imperial swordsman</b>

16:46.750 --> 16:49.620
<b>who couldn't protect my sister.</b>

16:51.580 --> 16:55.460
<b>This isn't how I want to feel fighting you!</b>

16:56.210 --> 17:04.500
<b>I want an excuse not to fight you 
right now. But there isn't any!</b>

17:05.730 --> 17:06.460
<b>Huh?</b>

17:07.320 --> 17:08.760
<b>Iska, your wrist...</b>

17:09.140 --> 17:09.760
<b>Huh?</b>

17:10.870 --> 17:12.220
<b>What is this?</b>

17:12.220 --> 17:13.310
<b>Could it be...</b>

17:14.240 --> 17:18.580
<b>A very small astral light. 
Because we stopped fighting,</b>

17:18.580 --> 17:22.860
<b>my astral light dimmed,
 and that's why we noticed it.</b>

17:23.320 --> 17:24.880
<b>I knew it, it's resonance!</b>

17:25.400 --> 17:29.340
<b>Yumilecia... Did you do something to her?</b>

17:29.830 --> 17:34.660
<b>M-Me? I didn't do anything, 
and she should be safe.</b>

17:35.070 --> 17:39.500
<b>That's not what I meant. Her astral 
spirit is able to leave a message.</b>

17:39.970 --> 17:40.940
<b>A message?</b>

17:41.710 --> 17:47.260
<b>She can leave a message 
by touching the messenger.</b>

17:48.730 --> 17:51.790
<b>You can take my life if I don't keep my word.</b>

17:53.140 --> 17:57.560
<b>Iska, I won't attack you. So can I come closer?</b>

18:00.140 --> 18:03.970
<b>It won't activate unless the person 
meant for the message touches it.</b>

18:04.990 --> 18:12.370
<b>Reporting. We servants pledge to the royal 
family that the spirit is speaking the truth.</b>

18:13.010 --> 18:17.290
<b>The Empire isn't the only one behind 
the Imperial army's invasion.</b>

18:18.000 --> 18:20.830
<b>The mastermind behind the coup is the Hydras.</b>

18:21.170 --> 18:26.110
<b>Their head, Talisman, attacked our vacation
house in disguise as an imperial soldier.</b>

18:26.630 --> 18:32.300
<b>The real imperial soldier saved us and 
is worried for Lady Sisbell's safety.</b>

18:33.060 --> 18:36.670
<b>Please show those four soldiers 
your kindness and compassion.</b>

18:37.210 --> 18:38.440
<b>It looks like</b>

18:39.580 --> 18:41.820
<b>you were telling me the truth all along.</b>

18:42.580 --> 18:45.300
<b>I was the one who was being deceived.</b>

18:52.970 --> 18:56.420
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry, I'm sorry!</b>

18:56.420 --> 19:03.650
<b>I really wanted to protect this nation 
and my family. Yet, why did I...</b>

19:04.030 --> 19:06.170
<b>I did such a horrible thing to you.</b>

19:06.170 --> 19:07.660
<b>Get up, Alice.</b>

19:07.660 --> 19:08.050
<b>Huh?</b>

19:08.800 --> 19:12.480
<b>What happens to the Sovereignty 
is none of my business.</b>

19:12.980 --> 19:17.640
<b>But I can't just leave Sisbell, 
so I'm going to rescue her.</b>

19:18.500 --> 19:20.690
<b>Are you just going to sit there?</b>

19:21.100 --> 19:23.370
<b>If that's what you want to do, I'm going.</b>

19:23.680 --> 19:25.330
<b>That's harsh.</b>

19:34.140 --> 19:40.330
<b>You can't say anything nice even 
when a girl is crying her eyes out.</b>

19:40.330 --> 19:42.740
<b>Nor will you give me a hand to get up.</b>

19:43.410 --> 19:45.790
<b>People from the Empire are 
uncivilized, I tell you.</b>

19:46.480 --> 19:49.650
<b>You're free to be disappointed. But—</b>

19:51.770 --> 19:52.670
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:56.190 --> 20:00.330
<b>Thank you for still seeing me as your rival.</b>

20:01.340 --> 20:07.330
<b>You treat me as an equal because our 
relationship will stay the same, right?</b>

20:09.050 --> 20:10.120
<b>Alice?</b>

20:26.590 --> 20:29.890
<b>Let me apologize again. I'm sorry.</b>

20:34.630 --> 20:38.640
<b>I resent the Imperial army for 
attacking the royal palace.</b>

20:38.640 --> 20:41.970
<b>And I will never forgive the Saint 
Disciple who cut down my mother.</b>

20:42.470 --> 20:46.850
<b>But I will never take out 
my negative emotions on you.</b>

20:47.180 --> 20:51.830
<b>I will go after the Hydras. You hide 
somewhere safe with the servants.</b>

20:55.340 --> 20:57.280
<b>It's the medical team that I requested.</b>

20:57.970 --> 20:59.460
<b>Now, go.</b>

21:00.180 --> 21:01.050
<b>Okay.</b>

21:03.460 --> 21:04.350
<b>Iska.</b>

21:05.150 --> 21:05.790
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:06.620 --> 21:09.960
<b>I'm glad I like you.</b>

21:11.600 --> 21:12.340
<b>Huh?</b>

21:14.030 --> 21:19.970
<b>N-No, I didn't mean it like that. 
I meant that I like you as a rival!</b>

21:20.890 --> 21:24.880
<b>Why do you look like that in the middle 
of something so important, like this?!</b>

21:25.970 --> 21:28.680
<b>A-And whose fault is it, I wonder?!</b>

21:34.380 --> 21:38.580
<b>I thought it was one of your 
new traps, so I braced myself.</b>

21:38.580 --> 21:43.850
<b>H-How rude! I'll never seduce anyone!</b>

21:44.970 --> 21:47.830
<b>Ugh, whatever. Just go.</b>

21:47.830 --> 21:49.000
<b>I sure will!</b>

21:50.520 --> 21:52.830
<b>You lucked out, Iska.</b>

21:54.680 --> 21:58.360
<b>We'll officially settle things the next time.</b>

22:01.250 --> 22:02.770
<b>So, be prepared.</b>

22:04.530 --> 22:06.370
<b>The next time, huh?</b>

22:08.890 --> 22:10.040
<b>The next time!</b>

22:13.220 --> 22:19.030
<b>When the sun is hiding at night, 
the moon is keeping watch.</b>

22:20.820 --> 22:26.030
<b>The one who invited the Imperial army 
is your master, Talisman. Am I right?</b>

22:28.290 --> 22:35.500
<b>Even at the last assassination attempt on the 
queen, you Hydras always move in the shadows.</b>

22:36.200 --> 22:40.170
<b>There are things you're better 
off not knowing in this world.</b>

22:40.740 --> 22:45.320
<b>Are you talking about how you 
can transform into a monster?</b>

22:45.680 --> 22:48.720
<b>Of course, you're free to stay just like that.</b>

22:48.720 --> 22:52.100
<b>But do you really think 
you can get away from me?</b>

22:52.100 --> 22:54.510
<b>Such a pathetic geezer.</b>

22:54.510 --> 22:58.940
<b>I'm sorry, but my hands are 
tied up with escorting Sisbell.</b>

22:59.230 --> 23:02.760
<b>So let me get you another playmate.</b>

23:02.760 --> 23:05.660
<b>A witch who's scarier than me.</b>

23:05.660 --> 23:06.700
<b>What?!</b>

23:09.620 --> 23:11.650
<b>Farewell, geezer.</b>

23:13.360 --> 23:17.890
<b>This overwhelming demonic 
presence... Who's there?!</b>

23:20.970 --> 23:23.150
<b>A... witch?</b>

23:24.350 --> 23:27.970
<b>Listen to the requiem of the stars.</b>

23:31.640 --> 23:33.520
<b>The message is as follows:</b>

23:33.920 --> 23:36.010
<b>Complete bed rest: One,</b>

23:36.550 --> 23:41.290
<b>Queen Millavair Lou Nebulis VIII: 
No life-threatening injuries,</b>

23:42.290 --> 23:44.710
<b>Missing persons: Three</b>

23:44.710 --> 23:48.540
<b>Head of Zoas, Growley: Whereabouts unknown.</b>

23:48.540 --> 23:50.160
<b>Seeking for any witnesses.</b>

23:50.820 --> 23:56.130
<b>The First Princess of Lou, Elletear: 
Kidnapped by the Imperial army.</b>

23:57.260 --> 24:04.220
<b>The Third Princess of Lou, Sisbell: Kidnapped by
the Imperial army at Lou's vacation house.</b>

24:15.070 --> 24:17.400
<b>Where am I?</b>

24:17.990 --> 24:21.530
<b>Iska? Captain Mismis?</b>

24:22.060 --> 24:24.250
<b>Nene? Jhin?</b>

24:27.190 --> 24:32.040
<b>Was I taken away by the Hydras?</b>

24:33.050 --> 24:37.920
<b>No way! I will never submit to them!</b>

24:39.920 --> 24:43.880
<b>I won't lose. Be brave, Sisbell!</b>

24:44.120 --> 24:47.130
<b>If I don't believe in them, who will?</b>

24:50.310 --> 24:55.020
<b>Astral spirits that guide this planet, please...</b>

24:56.010 --> 24:59.940
<b>May they hear my voice!</b>
